<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysians buy 25,000t US corn, seek 50,000t more.</title>
<headline>Malaysians buy 25,000t US corn, seek 50,000t more.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's Federal Flour Mills Bhd has bought 25,000 tonnes of U.S. corn for November shipment and December arrival, traders said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>They said the consignment was priced at around $160 a tonne C&amp;F.</p>
<p>Another buyer was negotiating on 50,000 tonnes of corn for November shipment to trade in Malaysia, dealers said.</p>
<p>&quot;The market price for this is around $155 (a tonne C&amp;F) but it could get lower,&quot; said a dealer.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-2307509)</p>
